@host = http://localhost:5080

### Catalog
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products

### Membership plans
GET {{host}}/api/v1/membership-plans

### Kata example: video + book + book club membership for customer 4567890 (total 48.50)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 4567890,
  "lines": [
    { "type": "Product", "productId": 1 },
    { "type": "Product", "productId": 2 },
    { "type": "Membership", "membershipType": "BookClub" }
  ],
  "expectedTotal": 48.50
}

### The processed order
GET {{host}}/api/v1/purchase-orders/3344656

### Its shipping slip (BR2)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/purchase-orders/3344656/shipping-slip

### The customer now has the book club membership (BR1)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/customers/4567890

### Digital only: no shipping slip
POST {{host}}/api/v1/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 4567890,
  "lines": [ { "type": "Product", "productId": 1 } ]
}

### Idempotent submit: send this request twice. The second call replays the first result
### (same order id, same Location, header "Idempotent-Replayed: true") and creates no second order.
### Reusing the key with a different body answers 409 (idempotency.payload_mismatch).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001

{
  "customerId": 4567890,
  "lines": [ { "type": "Membership", "membershipType": "VideoClub" } ]
}

### Same key, same body: replayed
POST {{host}}/api/v1/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001

{
  "customerId": 4567890,
  "lines": [ { "type": "Membership", "membershipType": "VideoClub" } ]
}

### Rejected: premium and book club overlap in one order (422)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 4567890,
  "lines": [
    { "type": "Membership", "membershipType": "Premium" },
    { "type": "Membership", "membershipType": "BookClub" }
  ]
}

### Rejected: physical product for a customer without a shipping address (422, nothing persisted)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 4567891,
  "lines": [ { "type": "Product", "productId": 2 } ]
}

### Register a customer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "shippingAddress": {
    "line1": "12 St James's Square",
    "city": "London",
    "postalCode": "SW1Y 4JH",
    "country": "United Kingdom"
  }
}

### Add a product
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "Book",
  "name": "The Pragmatic Programmer",
  "price": 42.00
}
